    "\n",
    "# Part II — PCA and exploratory behaviour profiles\n",
    "\n",
    "## 8. Standardisation\n",
    "\n",
    "PCA and K-means are sensitive to scale. Degrees, torso lengths and torso-lengths-per-second are therefore standardised before PCA.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "3737a59d",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "\n",
    "X = df[CORE_FEATURES].copy()\n",
    "\n",
    "scaler = StandardScaler()\n",
    "X_scaled = scaler.fit_transform(X)\n",
    "\n",
    "scaled_df = pd.DataFrame(X_scaled, columns=CORE_FEATURES, index=df.index)\n",
    "display(scaled_df.describe().round(3))\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "d56470fd",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "\n",
    "## 9. PCA explained variance and loadings\n",
    "\n",
    "PCA compresses correlated behaviour into orthogonal components. Loadings show how strongly each original feature contributes to each component.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "3faf00f8",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "\n",
    "pca_full = PCA(random_state=RANDOM_STATE)\n",
    "X_pca_full = pca_full.fit_transform(X_scaled)\n",
    "\n",
    "pca_variance = pd.DataFrame({\n",
    "    \"component\": [f\"PC{i+1}\" for i in range(len(CORE_FEATURES))],\n",
    "    \"explained_variance_ratio\": pca_full.explained_variance_ratio_,\n",
    "    \"cumulative_variance\": np.cumsum(pca_full.explained_variance_ratio_),\n",
    "})\n",
    "\n",
    "display(pca_variance.round(4))\n",
    "pca_variance.to_csv(OUTPUT_DIR / \"pca_variance.csv\", index=False)\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(8, 5))\n",
    "ax.bar(pca_variance[\"component\"], pca_variance[\"explained_variance_ratio\"])\n",
    "ax.plot(pca_variance[\"component\"], pca_variance[\"cumulative_variance\"], marker=\"o\")\n",
    "ax.set_ylim(0, 1.05)\n",
    "ax.set_title(\"PCA explained variance\")\n",
    "ax.set_ylabel(\"Variance ratio\")\n",
    "ax.set_xlabel(\"Principal component\")\n",
    "plt.show()\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "97f2f5b7",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "\n",
    "loadings = pd.DataFrame(\n",
    "    pca_full.components_.T,\n",
    "    index=CORE_FEATURES,\n",
    "    columns=[f\"PC{i+1}\" for i in range(len(CORE_FEATURES))]\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "display(loadings.round(3))\n",
    "loadings.to_csv(OUTPUT_DIR / \"pca_loadings.csv\")\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(9, 6))\n",
